Euler's tour algorithm. 
This is an algorithm which is used to flatten a tree into an array. 
There are 2 types in this
1) full eulers tour
2) eulers flattened tour

in the first type, every node's entry time and exit time along with their occurances are noted down. 

in the second type, onlt the entry type and the occurance is noted down. 

this algorithm is used when we need to find subtree sums, not once but many times. That is if we have many subtree sum queries. 

